### **Step 5: PL/SQL Block to Find Whether the Given Number is Odd or Even**

```sql
DECLARE
    num NUMBER := &number;  -- Replace &number with the input number
BEGIN
    IF MOD(num, 2) = 0 THEN
        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Even');
    ELSE
        DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE('Odd');
    END IF;
END;
```

